ish and Hindi; check Light and Dark modes on user-facing screens.\"],\"6\":3}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Network\"],\"6\":2}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Normal broadband, slow 3G, offline mid-flow and reconnect after 10\u201330 seconds.\"],\"6\":3}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Test data\"],\"6\":2}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Use synthetic users, documents, health text and gateway test mode. Never use real private or banking data.\"],\"6\":3}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Bug evidence\"],\"6\":2}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Capture screenshot/video, route, role, time, device/browser, request ID, API response and exact reproduction steps.\"],\"6\":3}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Source-of-truth\"],\"6\":2}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Current repository and deployed configuration override older examples. Confirm scope before filing a missing planned feature as a bug.\"],\"6\":3}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Release blockers\"],\"6\":2}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Auth bypass, guardian/private-data access, duplicate payments/refunds, unbalanced ledger, unsafe AI diagnosis/prescription, cross-user report/file access, secret leakage and concurrent slot/session duplication.\"],\"6\":3}],[],[],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Source Basis\"],\"6\":4}],[],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"MindHeal Complete Project Blueprint.pdf\"],\"6\":5}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Website, identity, user, counsellor, admin, AI, assessments, consultation, finance, backend, security, CMS, UX and quality gates.\"],\"6\":6}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"MindHeal Self-Assessment \\u0026 Screening Implementation Plan.md\"],\"6\":5}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Deterministic scoring, safety, access, AI Credits, sharing, assessment library and testing.\"],\"6\":6}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"MindHeal User App Style Guide.txt\"],\"6\":5}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Light/dark design, components, typography, spacing, motion, states and accessibility.\"],\"6\":6}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Latest approved product rules\"],\"6\":5}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"15+ users, guardian controls, adult AI access, 21+ professionals, 10% commission, weekly payouts and English/Hindi launch.\"],\"6\":6}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"Talk to Someone approved specification\"],\"6\":5}],[{\"2\":3,\"3\":[2,\"18+ paid peer-listener flow, one active session, five-minute text gate, mutual consent, safety exit, feedback and earnings.\"],\"6\":6}]]]"
